    "media:imagetext": "OVERSEAS NATIONAL AIRWAYS\nDOUGLAS DC-8-60 SERIES\nTake-off and landing\nStart und Landung\nDécollage et\nalessage\nDespegue y aterrizaje\nDecolacem e\naterrissagem\nDecollo e atterraggio\nSAFETY PROCEDURES\nSICHERHEIT AN BOARD\nNOTICE DE SECURITE\nNo smoking\nEmergency exit\nRemove shoes\nNicht rauchen\nNotausgang\nSchuhe ausziehen\nNe pas fumer\nEXIT\nSortie de secours\nEnlever les souliers\nNo fumar\nSalida de urgencia\nDescalzar\nNão fumar\nSaida de emergéncia\nDescalçar os sapatos\nNon fumare\nUscita di emergenza\nTogliere le scarpe\n•Апауорейста!\n\"ELOdOS KIVOúVOU\nByáÀTE та папотаа\njail egia\n2\n3\nOXYGEN\nOxygen\nSauerstoff\nOxygène\nOxigeno\nOxigénio\nOssigeno\nOzuyóvo\nMAIN CABIN DOORS\n3\nEXIT\nA\n2\nPull handle in\nand down.\nJET ESCAPE DOORS\n3\nLet go of handle when\nexit starts to fall out.\nRemove shoes and\nall sharp objects.\nJump and sit\nNO SHOES\n3\nEXIT\nB\n3\nOXYGEN",
