    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "OVERSEAS NATIONAL AIRWAYS\nDOUGLAS DC-8-60 SERIES\nTake-off and landing\nStart und Landung\nDécollage et\nalessage\nDespegue y aterrizaje\nDecolacem e\naterrissagem\nDecollo e atterraggio\nSAFETY PROCEDURES\nSICHERHEIT AN BOARD\nNOTICE DE SECURITE\nNo smoking\nEmergency exit\nRemove shoes\nNicht rauchen\nNotausgang\nSchuhe ausziehen\nNe pas fumer\nEXIT\nSortie de secours\nEnlever les souliers\nNo fumar\nSalida de urgencia\nDescalzar\nNão fumar\nSaida de emergéncia\nDescalçar os sapatos\nNon fumare\nUscita di emergenza\nTogliere le scarpe\n•Апауорейста!\n\"ELOdOS KIVOúVOU\nByáÀTE та папотаа\njail egia\n2\n3\nOXYGEN\nOxygen\nSauerstoff\nOxygène\nOxigeno\nOxigénio\nOssigeno\nOzuyóvo\nMAIN CABIN DOORS\n3\nEXIT\nA\n2\nPull handle in\nand down.\nJET ESCAPE DOORS\n3\nLet go of handle when\nexit starts to fall out.\nRemove shoes and\nall sharp objects.\nJump and sit\nNO SHOES\n3\nEXIT\nB\n3\nOXYGEN",
      "AUSGÄNGE\nSORTIES\nCEILING/OVERHEAD\nRACK RAFT\n1. Raft compartment\nis opened by pulling\nhandle toward you.\n2. Raft may then\nbe removed from compartment/\ndoor and launched\nout nearest exit.\nLIFE RAFT\nSTOWAGE COMPARTMENT\nEmergency landing\nNotlandung\nAtterrissage forcé\nAterrizaje forzoso\nAterrissagem forçada\nAtterraggio forzato\nпросудшас\nLanding on waiter\nWasserung\nAmerrissage\nAmaraje\nAmaragem\nAmmaraggio\n• job gal\n2\n2\nCEILING\nDOOR\nRemove shoes\nSchuhe ausziehen\nEnlever les souliers\nDescalzar\nDescalçar os sapatos\nTogliere le scarpe\nВуалтє та папойтоа\n3\n3\n8 3.\nба\nNO SMOKING\n2002.127.439"
